[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0438","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0438.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10892","title":"Google Chrome V8 整型溢出漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 JavaScript 引擎存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），远程攻击者可构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发 V8 引擎在处理数组操作时的整数溢出，导致堆内存破坏。成功利用该漏洞可实现任意代码执行，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Chrome 140.0.7339.207 之前版本及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge、Fedora 等衍生软件，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。用户需升级至 Chrome 140.0.7339.207 或更高版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10892"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-24T17:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:13Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 140.0.7339.207 及以上版本（通过设置→关于 Chrome→自动检查更新）；Microsoft Edge 用户升级至 140.0.3485.94 及以上版本；基于 Chromium 的第三方浏览器（如 Opera、Brave）请跟进厂商更新。Linux 发行版用户（如 Fedora）执行包管理器更新至 chromium 140.0.7339.207。无法立即升级时，可启用 Chrome 的站点隔离（Site Isolation）功能并禁用 V8 JIT（通过 --jitless 启动参数）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_23.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/444048019","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-10892.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10892.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7cbd46ac4e2574be115c8b4e081aab80c1276132/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10892.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/eed339cf256327c44d192c0d80436ef03b70d37e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-10892","https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/blob/0a918126b9e7fd11d49cb100c32a439da9d3d30d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/26b1624e7cfc064c03ff9708ab669340f79397a3/community/qt6-qtwebengine/APKBUILD","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/75b5e380a041f7d82baaaae75856fe8702a1ff30/2025/CVE-2025-10892.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-h6c6-w