但需要用户交互。Google 已在 Chrome 140.0.7339.185 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10501"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-24T17:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:28:26Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 140.0.7339.185 或更高版本（Chrome 菜单 > 帮助 > 关于 Google Chrome 自动检查更新）；基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Opera）同步更新至对应版本。Linux 发行版用户通过包管理器更新：Fedora 升级至 chromium-140.0.7339.207，Debian/Ubuntu 升级至包含该修复的 chromium 版本。如无法立即更新，可在浏览器设置中禁用 WebRTC（chrome://flags/#disable-webrtc）或通过企业策略阻止不可信来源的 WebRTC 连接作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_17.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/440737137","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-10501.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10501.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12ccf92eecf2db493c63630fd06d8245f1d02476/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10501.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-10501","https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/blob/0a918126b9e7fd11d49cb100c32a439da9d3d30d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/c577f578f3055fa6fa37790f3166f0266a7f0a80/community/qt6-qtwebengine/APKBUILD","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-4q3x-7jmg-pjmq/GHSA-4q3x-7jmg-pjmq.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-10501.md","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-10501","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-10501.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc