eviewed/2025/09/GHSA-55qp-h28c-5r3m/GHSA-55qp-h28c-5r3m.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-10500","https://github.com/hypnguyen1209/offensive-claude/blob/4d62be716fff90fb3249e525e8c771cf621f20c8/skills/browser-exploitation/references/renderer-to-browser-escape.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0428.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0435","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0435.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10824","title":"axboe fio 释放后使用漏洞","description":"axboe fio 3.41 及之前版本的 init.c 文件中 __parse_jobs_ini 函数存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞。攻击者需在本地环境下，通过精心构造的输入操控该函数处理逻辑，触发已释放内存的再次引用，可能导致程序崩溃或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响使用 fio 进行磁盘基准测试的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 4.0 评分 1.9（低危），利用代码已公开披露。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10824"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-23T01:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:04Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 fio 至 3.42 或更高版本（如 Ubuntu 24.04 的 fio 3.38-2ubuntu0.1 或更高版本已回港修复补丁）。如暂时无法升级，可限制本地用户执行 fio 配置文件解析权限（chmod 640 /etc/fio/ 等配置目录），或通过 SELinux/AppArmor 限制 fio 进程访问权限作为临时缓解措施。建议通过包管理器（apt upgrade fio / yum update fio / dnf update fio）直接升级到修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/axboe/fio/issues/1981","https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22266756/poc.zip","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.325181","https://vuldb.com/?id.325181","https://vuldb.com/?submit.654072","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-10824.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10824.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-10824.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-10824","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/127f7a4b9d7673fe587aa4d23159796f35b94385/upstream-layers/meta-openembedded/meta-oe/recipes-benchmark/fio/fio_3.42.bb","https://github.com/livecvebench/LiveCVEBench-Preview/blob/b11057ac5288aa4ed595452f7e5f1df9919dbc00/tasks/LiveCVEBench/cve-2025-10824/solution.sh","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7cbd46ac4e2574be115c8b4e081aab80c1276132/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10824.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-10824.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-27g4-h3mx-8j8p/GHSA-27g4-h3mx-8j8p.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2025-10824"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0435.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0434","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0434.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10823","title":"axboe fio 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"axboe fio 3.41 及之前版本的 options.c 文件中 str_buffer_pattern_cb 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞（CWE-404），攻击者可通过本地构造恶意输入参数触发空指针解引用，导致 fio 进程崩溃造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 fio 3.41 及之前所有版本，攻击向量为本地（AV:L），需低权限（PR:L）且无需用户交互（UI:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），CVSS 4.0 评分 1.9（低危），主要影响可用性（VA:L）。利用代码已公开（GitHub Issue #1982 及 poc.zip），攻击者可在本地执行 PoC 触发崩溃。建议升级至 fio 3.41 以上版本或应用官方补丁（如 Ubuntu CVE-2025-10823 补丁、Xilinx meta-openembedded 补丁）修复该漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10823"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-23T00:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:04Z","remediation":"升级到 axboe fio 版本 3.42 或更高版本，其中包含对 CVE-2025-10823 的修复。具体操作：1) 从官网或 distribution 升级到最新稳定版 2) 系统中无现成包时，克隆官方仓库代码并打下游补丁以修复 options.c 中的 str_buffer_pattern_cb 空指针问题 3) 如果无法立即升级，临时缓解措施为运行测试时禁用修改可能引发空指针行为的特定 pattern pattern 使用选项，并在/usr/include 目录下设置 TMPDIR 环境变量以隔离测试临时文件；由于该漏洞仅在本地环境下触发，仅需确保用户权限控制，限制 test user 到非 root 用户，运行测试时避免使用 untrusted 输入，该方案可作为完整版号发布前的短期替换方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/axboe/fio/issues/1982","https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22266964/poc.zip","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.325180","https://vuldb.com/?id.325180","https://vuldb.com/?submit.654069","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-10823.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10823.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-10823.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-10823","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-oe/recipes-benchmark/fio/fio/CVE-2025-10823.patch","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7cbd46ac4e2574be115c8b4e081aab80c1276132/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10823.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-10823.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-fg45-43v5-3rqm/GHSA-fg45-43v5-3rqm.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2025-10823","https://github.com/foundriesio/docs/blob/b32690674227bf152524150ec37bf4fd5be6045b/release-notes/v96/changelog_v96.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0434.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0099","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-48703","title":"CWP CentOS Web Panel filemanager 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CWP（Control Web Panel，又称 CentOS Web Panel）0.9.8.1205 之前版本的文件管理器模块中存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者在已知一个有效非 root 用户名的情况下，可通过向 /myuser/index.php?module=filemanager&acc=changePerm 端点发送特制请求，在 t_total 参数中注入 shell 元字符执行任意系统命令，导致未经身份认证的远程代码执行。该漏洞影响大量使用 CWP 面板的 CentOS 服务器，CVSS 评分 9.0，危害等级严重。厂商已在 0.9.8.1205 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-48703"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-09-19T18:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:30:12Z","remediation":"立即将 Control Web Panel (CWP) 升级至 0.9.8.1205 或更高版本。升级命令：`sh <(curl -fsSL https://control-web-panel.com/install/update.sh)`。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置访问控制，限制 `/myuser/index.php` 路径仅允许可信 IP 访问，并删除或限制 `filemanager` 模块的未授权调用权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fenrisk.com/rce-centos-webpanel","https://control-webpanel.com/changelog","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-48703","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-48703.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-48703.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-48703.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-48703.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-48703-Sq-CC_CVE-2025-48703.md","https://github.com/wooluo/nuclei-templates-2025hw/blob/37e9617426e2a696c8c338b15df99abd6294a4eb/cve-2025-48703.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-48703/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-48703.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/2025/48xxx/CVE-2025-48703.json","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/6ca38245cd4f76ea240e519a68d43bb56ac01013/src/content/changelog/waf/2025-08-04-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2025-48703.html","https://github.com/Skynoxk/CVE-2025-48703","https://github.com/itstarsec/CVE-2025-48703","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-48703"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0008","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10035","title":"Fortra GoAnywhere MFT 许可证 Servlet 反序列化命令注入漏洞","description":"Fortra GoAnywhere MFT 的许可证 Servlet（License Servlet）存在不安全的反序列化漏洞。由于该组件在验证许可证响应时仅依赖可被合法伪造的签名，具备有效伪造签名的攻击者能够构造并反序列化由攻击者完全控制的任意对象，进而在服务器端触发命令注入，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 Fortra GoAnywhere MFT 的相关版本，攻击者可经网络远程利用，无需身份认证即可通过特制的许可证响应请求达成利用，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10035"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-09-18T22:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:33Z","remediation":"立即将 GoAnywhere MFT 升级至 7.6.3 或 7.8.4 及以上版本以修复 License Servlet 反序列化漏洞。升级前请确认许可证响应签名验证机制已正确配置，升级后重启 License Servlet 服务。若暂无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制对 License Servlet 路径的访问，仅允许可信 IP 访问，并监控异常出站连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.fortra.com/security/advisories/product-security/fi-2025-012","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-10035","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-10035.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-10035.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2672e36893bd220d6f65c955e260796d11ed64b/2025/CVE-2025-10035.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-10035.yaml","https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/bc433784ede7dbd633c8f5b318929cce6dea621a/rules-emerging-threats/2025/Exploits/CVE-2025-10035/proc_creation_win_exploit_cve_2025_10035.yml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/9e669818e6334d592d44717c5ec3d75ca4cc97e4/data/2025/CVE-2025-10035-rxerium_CVE-2025-10035.md","https://github.com/vuldb/cyber_threat_intelligence/blob/6a5017307e035c2b54c7afbe3bd8582497eafa96/campaigns/c/CVE-2025-10035/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-10035.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10035.json","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/6ca38245cd4f76ea240e519a68d43bb56ac01013/src/content/changelog/waf/2025-09-24-emergency-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2025/CVE-2025-10035.poc","https://github.com/rxerium/CVE-2025-10035","https://github.com/ThemeHackers/CVE-2025-10035","https://github.com/sentinel-aidefense/CVE-2025-10035","https://github.com/orange0Mint/CVE-2025-10035_GoAnywhere","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-10035"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0423","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0423.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10148","title":"curl WebSocket掩码可预测漏洞","description":"curl 的 WebSocket 实现未按 RFC 规范要求为每个新发出的数据帧更新 32 位掩码值，而是在整个连接期间使用固定的可预测掩码。恶意服务器可利用此缺陷构造特制的 WebSocket 数据帧，使中间代理（透明或显式配置）将伪造流量误判为真实 HTTP 通信并缓存其内容，导致缓存投毒攻击。该缓存中的恶意内容随后可被代理分发给所有用户。攻击者需能够与目标客户端建立 WebSocket 连接并控制服务端，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10148"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-12T06:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:47Z","remediation":"升级 curl 至 8.14.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 WebSocket 掩码未按规范每帧更新的问题。如无法立即升级，可在代理或反向代理层禁用 WebSocket 连接转发，或限制 curl 仅用于非 WebSocket 场景作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-10148.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-10148.json","https://hackerone.com/reports/3330839","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/09/10/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/09/10/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/09/10/4","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-10148.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10148.json","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/245bd197493b521edc2f9a005c35c1a1d3e731ff/docs/CVE-2025-10148.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-10148.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-10148","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12b56937c03071ca373f3f6a59d2f43e819052a3/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10148.json","https://github.com/reddelexc/hackerone-reports/blob/420e41078cd65f59f446c2dc4b337051e83055bc/docs/tops_by_program/TOPCURL.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/a776c2f93aca32bd4efdcb44fddb0c44dc7e1c5a/main/curl/APKBUILD","https://github.com/controlplaneio-fluxcd/distribution/blob/8973a47d048ce08dcfd708d8fe1880d18681ba9c/.trivyignore","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CVE-2025-10148-2025-12-23-0705"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0423.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0426","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0426.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10201","title":"Google Chrome Mojo 站点隔离绕过漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 Mojo 组件中存在不当实现漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，从而绕过站点隔离机制（Site Isolation），导致攻击者能够访问其他站点的敏感数据或执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 Android、Linux 及 ChromeOS 平台上 Chrome 140.0.7339.127 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Google 已在 Chrome 140.0.7339.127 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10201"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-10T19:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:53Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 140.0.7339.127 及以上版本（Chrome 菜单 > 帮助 > 关于 Google Chrome 自动检查更新）。Linux 发行版用户通过包管理器更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt update && apt upgrade chromium-browser`，Fedora 执行 `dnf update chromium` 至 140.0.7339.207。Android 用户通过 Google Play 商店更新 Chrome。无法立即升级时，可在浏览器设置中启用「严格站点隔离」（chrome://flags/#strict-site-isolation）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_9.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/439305148","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-10201.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10201.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12b56937c03071ca373f3f6a59d2f43e819052a3/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10201.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-10201","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-10201.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/a776c2f93aca32bd4efdcb44fddb0c44dc7e1c5a/community/qt6-qtwebengine/APKBUILD","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-fq52-757j-7h2p/GHSA-fq52-757j-7h2p.json","https://github.com/xaitax/Chrome-App-Bound-Encryption-Decryption/blob/63b719f2ab3dbf8573fd9228a9c028526e9eb1db/docs/The_Elevator_Gets_an_Upgrade_Chrome_